  "cues": [
    {
      "start": 0.5,
      "text": "一个想法，怎么变成故事？一起试试。",
      "duration": 4.442667,
      "audio": "assets/narration/voice-00.wav",
      "voice": "zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural"
    },
    {
      "start": 5.6,
      "text": "打开项目，选好模型，就可以开始创作了。",
      "duration": 4.250667,
      "audio": "assets/narration/voice-01.wav",
      "voice": "zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural"
    },
    {
      "start": 13.6,
      "text": "告诉它你想写什么。人物是谁，故事发生在哪儿，最后保存成什么文件。",
      "duration": 7.226667,
      "audio": "assets/narration/voice-02.wav",
      "voice": "zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural"
    },
    {
      "start": 23.6,
      "text": "核对文件位置，点击允许。这份初稿，就保存到项目里了。",
      "duration": 6.242667,
      "audio": "assets/narration/voice-03.wav",
      "voice": "zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural"
    },
    {
      "start": 31.6,
      "text": "生成之后，点开文件，读一遍正文。看看人物、情节和语气，是不是你想要的。",
      "duration": 8.258667,
      "audio": "assets/narration/voice-04.wav",
      "voice": "zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural"
    },
    {
      "start": 43.6,
      "text": "想怎么改，直接告诉它。可以改一句，也可以调整章节，或者整体重写。",
      "duration": 7.394667,
      "audio": "assets/narration/voice-05.wav",
      "voice": "zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural"
    },
    {
      "start": 53.6,
      "text": "打开修改对比。红色是删去的，绿色是新增的。确认满意，再点击接受。",
      "duration": 8.186667,
      "audio": "assets/narration/voice-06.wav",
      "voice": "zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural"
    },
    {
      "start": 65.6,
      "text": "这次，悬念落在了人物的动作上。他攥着钱，没有回头。",
      "duration": 6.074667,
      "audio": "assets/narration/voice-07.wav",
      "voice": "zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural"
    },
    {
      "start": 74,
      "text": "说出想法，检查结果，再慢慢打磨。开始你的创作吧。",
      "duration": 5.8005,
      "audio": "assets/narration/voice-08.wav",
      "voice": "zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural"
    }
  ]
}
